1
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:51,599
Things just got a little more despicable.

2
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:37,199
Despicable Me 4 is a family, comedy, animation film directed by Chris Renaud.

3
00:11:16,799 --> 00:11:22,799
Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to
the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad.

4
00:15:02,399 --> 00:15:08,399
Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale
girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.

5
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
Gru (voice), played by Steve Carell.

6
00:22:33,599 --> 00:22:39,599
Lucy (voice), played by Kristen Wiig.

7
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:25,200
Maxime (voice), played by Will Ferrell.

8
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:10,799
Valentina (voice), played by Sofía Vergara.

9
00:33:50,399 --> 00:33:56,399
Margo (voice), played by Miranda Cosgrove.

10
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:42,000
Edith (voice), played by Dana Gaier.

11
00:41:21,599 --> 00:41:27,599
Despicable Me 4 is a 2024 American animated comedy film directed by
Chris Renaud and written by Mike White and Ken Daurio.

12
00:45:07,199 --> 00:45:13,199
Produced by Illumination and distributed by Universal Pictures, it is the sequel to
Despicable Me 3 (2017) and the sixth film in the Despicable Me franchise.

13
00:48:52,799 --> 00:48:58,799
The film stars the voices of Steve Carell, Kristen Wiig, Pierre Coffin, Joey King,
Miranda Cosgrove, Stephen Colbert, Sofía Vergara, and Will Ferrell.

14
00:52:38,400 --> 00:52:44,400
The film sees reformed supervillain and secret agent Gru temporarily relocate his
family to a safe house when his old rival Maxime Le Mal seeks revenge.

15
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:30,000
Subplots deal with Gru's family adjusting to their new lives, teenage neighbor Poppy Prescott trying to follow
in Gru's footsteps, and a group of Gru's Minions becoming superheroes known as the Mega Minions.

16
01:00:09,599 --> 01:00:15,599
Development on a fourth main Despicable Me film began in September 2017.

17
01:03:55,199 --> 01:04:01,199
It was officially confirmed in February 2022, with Renaud, Delage, and White
attached as director, co-director, and writer, respectively.

18
01:07:40,799 --> 01:07:46,799
Production was underway by June 2022.

19
01:11:26,399 --> 01:11:32,399
Most of the main voice cast was announced in January 2024, with Hoffman and
Daurio revealed as co-producer and co-writer, respectively.

20
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
Heitor Pereira and Pharrell Williams returned from previous installments to
compose the score and write original songs and themes, respectively.

21
01:18:57,599 --> 01:19:03,599
Despicable Me 4 debuted at the Jazz at Lincoln Center in New York on June 9,
2024, and was theatrically released in the United States on July 3.

22
01:22:43,199 --> 01:22:49,199
Despite mixed reviews, the film continued the franchise's streak of box-office successes, grossing $972 million
worldwide against a budget of $100 million, making it the fourth-highest-grossing film of 2024.

23
01:26:28,800 --> 01:26:34,800
The film explores themes of superhero, villain,
sequel, super villain, aftercreditsstinger.

24
01:30:14,399 --> 01:30:20,399
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
